================================================================================
BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY FONTS
================================================================================

Cal Sans  (public/fonts/calsans-latin.woff2, public/fonts/calsans-latinext.woff2)
  Headings are set in the Cal Sans display typeface (latin + latin-extended
  subsets, self-hosted).
  Copyright the Cal.com, Inc. team and contributors.
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Cal+Sans

Quantico  (public/fonts/quantico-400-latin.woff2,
           public/fonts/quantico-700-latin.woff2)
  The interface text is set in Quantico (latin subset, regular + bold,
  self-hosted).
  Copyright Madtype.
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Quantico

Zen Dots  (public/fonts/zendots-latin.woff2,
           public/fonts/zendots-latinext.woff2)
  The wordmark and section headings are set in Zen Dots
  (latin + latin-extended subsets, self-hosted).
  Copyright Yoshimichi Ohira.
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Zen+Dots


================================================================================
DATA RETRIEVED AT RUNTIME
================================================================================

MusicBrainz
  Catalogue records are fetched from the MusicBrainz web service. MusicBrainz
  core data is released into the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal;
  supplementary data (such as genre tags) is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 3.0.
  MusicBrainz is operated by the MetaBrainz Foundation.
  https://musicbrainz.org/doc/About/Data_License

Cover Art Archive
  Album covers are hotlinked from the Cover Art Archive, a joint project of
  the Internet Archive and MetaBrainz. Images remain the property of their
  respective rights holders.
  https://coverartarchive.org

Wikipedia / Wikidata / Wikimedia Commons
  Artist summaries and portraits are fetched at runtime; text is CC BY-SA,
  images carry their own Commons licences.

Discogs
  Artist profiles and photos are fetched from the Discogs API as a fallback;
  content remains the property of Discogs and its contributors.

